{"product_id":"nova-smart-watch","title":"Nova Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eNova Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpgrade your tech with the Nova Smartwatch, where innovation meets elegance. Make your daily routine more productive and stylish with a smartwatch designed to keep pace with your life. Order your Nova Smartwatch today and embrace the perfect blend of technology and fashion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Nova Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Nova Smartwatch is equipped with a range of features to keep you on track and connected. Its advanced fitness tracking includes heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and various sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with smart notifications for calls, messages, and social media alerts, all displayed on a vibrant, high-resolution screen. The long-lasting battery ensures you stay powered throughout your day, and customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps let you personalize your look.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Nova Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.3-inch TFT full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 360 x 360 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 45 x 38 x 10 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 7 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 40g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Nova SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpting for the Nova Smartwatch means choosing a device that enhances your life with its advanced features and stylish design. Its comprehensive health tracking, seamless connectivity, and elegant appearance make it a top choice. Plus, with our dedicated customer support, you can enjoy a hassle-free experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47263090180374,"sku":"20096","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Golden","offer_id":47263090311446,"sku":"20101","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47263090213142,"sku":"20097","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Nova Gray","offer_id":47263090344214,"sku":"20100","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":47263090245910,"sku":"20103","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rainbow","offer_id":47263090278678,"sku":"20093","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Dark-Black.webp?v=1705740899","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/nova-smart-watch","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}